            {
              "key": "solution",
              "html": "<p>В тре­уголь­ни­ке <var data-math-identifier=\"ABC\">ABC</var></p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\angle C=180^{\\circ}-\\angle A-\\angle B=180^{\\circ}-76^{\\circ}-65^{\\circ}=39^{\\circ}\"></span>.</p></center><p>В тре­уголь­ни­ке <var data-math-identifier=\"ACF\">ACF</var></p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\angle F=180^{\\circ}-\\angle A-\\angle ACF=180^{\\circ}-76^{\\circ}-\\frac{39^{\\circ}}{2}=84{,}5^{\\circ}\"></span>. </p></center><p>В тре­уголь­ни­ке <var data-math-identifier=\"AOF\">AOF</var></p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\angle AOF=180^{\\circ}-\\angle OAF-\\angle F=180^{\\circ}-\\frac{76^{\\circ}}{2}-84{,}5^{\\circ}=57{,}5^{\\circ}\"></span>. </p></center>",
